{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object with specific properties. If not found, scan area. Then do task. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithDesiredProperties    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
